\begin{enumerate}
\item date: ../../..\ \ \ \ \ author:
\item date: ../../..\ \ \ \ \ author:
\end{enumerate}
\item[* task:] To substitute NPs for NPVARs under S, in particular for
variables bearing relation shiftrel (wh and topic)
\item[\ \ strategy:] (also: deviations from accepted proposals) Note that 
topicalized NPs do not get a {\em topicmood} from the Surface parser, just 
{\em nowh}; thus there are two subrules, one for the case the mood stays the 
same (wh), and one for when it does not (topic)
